   274	A) and aqueous trifluoro acetic acid (TFA, 0.01% v/v)
   275	(Solvent B), the column was thermostatically controlled at 220
   276	C and 20 μl solution was injected. A gradient elution was
   277	performed by varying the proportion of solvent A to solvent
   278	B. The gradient elusion was 1 % A and 99 % B with flow rate
   279	0.5 ml/min in 5 min, from 1 % to 25% A with flow rate 0.5
   280	ml/min for 16 min, 45 % A, with flow rate 0.5 ml/min for 8
