   457	rate 0.3 to 0.7ml/min in 70 min, 44% A with flow rate 0.7 to
   458	1ml/min for 10 min duration, solvent A changed from 44% to
   459	58 % with flow rate 1ml/min for 5 min, 58 to 70% A in 98
   460	min at constant flow rate 1 ml/min. The mobile phase
   461	composition back to initial condition (solvent A: solvent B:
